    "notes": [
      "Record from the organ's MIDI OUT and play back into its MIDI IN. Keep the SysEx and Control Change transmit filters off in the MIDI menu.",
      "Press the Cancel piston (C) before recording so every stop starts off.",
      "In SETTINGS > MIDI set OUT MODE to OUT and NOTES TO COUPL. to NO, so only the notes actually played are sent."
